WEBVTT

00:03.880 --> 00:08.760
Okay, so now one more thing before we jump to the next use case that there is one rule to follow if

00:08.760 --> 00:14.200
you are using case statements, and that is that data types of the results must be matching.

00:14.200 --> 00:19.440
So what this means if we check again our example over here, we can see that the result of each condition

00:19.440 --> 00:20.520
is a string.

00:20.520 --> 00:22.880
So as you can see we have here high medium and low.

00:22.880 --> 00:25.920
And all of those informations are following the same data type.

00:25.920 --> 00:26.960
So it is correct.

00:26.960 --> 00:32.640
So now if I go and break this rule for example after this then let's have the value two.

00:32.680 --> 00:35.400
So now we have a number and we have characters.

00:35.400 --> 00:36.920
So let's go and execute it.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.240
And now of course we're going to get an error.

00:38.240 --> 00:43.920
Because now SQL is trying to convert the value low to an integer which is incorrect.

00:43.920 --> 00:47.320
So the data types of the output of the result must be matching.

00:47.320 --> 00:54.280
And that's not only include the value after the then, but also the value after the else, because this

00:54.280 --> 00:56.280
value is as well part of the output.

00:56.280 --> 00:57.920
So let's have here again medium.

00:58.280 --> 01:01.640
And now let's go and change this to let's say one.

01:01.800 --> 01:07.000
So let's go and execute it again SQL going to throw an error because this is an integer number.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.120
And the others are string characters.

01:09.120 --> 01:11.280
So this is the rule of using the case statement.

01:11.280 --> 01:15.080
The data types after then and after else must be matching.

01:15.120 --> 01:19.920
And if you ask me whether there is restriction about where you can use the case statement in which clauses,

01:20.120 --> 01:26.680
you can use it everywhere and select enjoins from where groupby order by everywhere.

01:26.680 --> 01:29.880
So there are no restrictions and we have only this one rule.
